  "description": "Visual tree/field editor for CrudApi's AI-generated tenant config JSON — a viewer/editor over the pipeline CrudConfigApplicationService already produces, not a reimplementation of it. Reads/writes through the same git-backed store (WebSvc.GitOps), with version history read from real commits rather than a shadow database table. No SQL storage of its own — sessions persist to a JSON file, same pattern as WebSvc.SqliteAdmin. Platform-admin only, reached via a signed one-click handoff from CrudAdmin's Databases page.",
